0 FILE 10264 - main.ldr
0 The complete Corner Garage model, featuring a multi-story corner building with white, light bluish grey, and medium nougat walls, dark green accents, windows, doors, a staircase, a baseplate foundation, a German Shepherd dog, and accessories like a broom, hand truck, and D-basket, populated by several minifigures, a scooter, and a tow truck.
0 Name: 10264 - main.ldr
0 Author: Jaco van der Molen [Jaco van der Molen]
